meta {
  name: Admin Delete Truck (verified included)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/trucks/admin/{{truckId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  VAHN_ADMIN only (`TruckResource.adminDeleteTruck`, service `TruckService.adminDeleteTruck`).
  Soft-deletes a truck even when it is VERIFIED, unassigning its driver first. `{id}` is digits only.

  Set `truckId` (and a VAHN_ADMIN `accessToken`) before running. Only use a throwaway truck.

  Success is 204; staging wraps it as HTTP 200 with `statusCode: 204` in the body. A missing or
  already-deleted id gives body `statusCode: 404`; a non-admin token gives body `statusCode: 403`.
  The regular `DELETE /api/trucks/{id}` still refuses VERIFIED trucks.

  Journey with assertions: `bruno/flows/plutus-api/admin-truck-force-delete`.
}
